  "remaining": [
    "All builds, tests, typechecks, numerical, performance, image quality, crash/reopen and packaging acceptance UNRUN. Missing selection ABI remains unavailable without fallback.",
    "Manual image-leaf selection only; vector drafts not persisted across restart, no group/semantic selection or native-size inspection. Box feather and subpixel approximation are not vendor/Gaussian parity.",
